{"type": "root", "attrs": {"type": "node", "context": "sop", "namespace": "kinefx", "internal": "motionmixersmooth", "icon": "SOP/kinefx-motionmixersmooth", "tags": "animation", "since": "21.0", "allow_hidden": "true", "version": null}, "body": [{"tag": "div", "attrs": {"style": "position: relative;"}, "type": "xml", "text": ["\n    ", {"tag": "div", "attrs": {"style": "float: left; width: 5em;"}, "type": "xml", "text": ["\n        ", {"scheme": "Image", "value": "/images/beta.svg", "type": "link", "text": "", "fullpath": "/images/beta.svg.html"}, "\n    "]}, "\n    ", {"tag": "div", "attrs": {"style": "margin-left: 5em; padding-left: 1em; min-height: 4em;"}, "type": "xml", "text": ["\n        This feature is still under development. The current functionality is\n        unfinished and subject to change, and may have thin or no documentation.\n        Please bear this in mind when using it.\n    "]}, "\n"]}, {"level": 0, "type": "title", "indent": 0, "text": ["Motion Mixer Smooth"], "extent": [184, 208]}, {"type": "summary", "indent": 0, "text": ["Defines a smooth effect for the motion mixer."], "extent": [208, 262]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 0, "text": ["The motion mixer\u2019s smooth effect smooths out unwanted noise by applying a Butterworth filter to remove the frequencies that exceed a specified cut-off frequency, similar to the ", {"scheme": "Node", "value": "/nodes/sop/kinefx--smoothmotion", "type": "link", "text": ["Smooth Motion SOP"], "fullpath": "/nodes/sop/kinefx--smoothmotion.html"}, ". This node defines an APEX graph that performs a smooth effect on the MixerAnim.skel of a single character. MixerAnim.skel is a skeleton that contains the control transforms of the character, and is output by the motion mixer."], "extent": [262, 717]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 0, "text": ["This effect is invoked internally by the ", {"scheme": "Node", "value": "/nodes/sop/kinefx--motionmixer", "type": "link", "text": ["Motion Mixer SOP"], "fullpath": "/nodes/sop/kinefx--motionmixer.html"}, " and uses multiple MixerAnim.skel samples. See ", {"scheme": null, "value": "/character/kinefx/motionmixer#smootheffect", "type": "link", "text": ["smooth effect"], "fullpath": "/character/kinefx/motionmixer.html#smootheffect", "fragment": "#smootheffect"}, " for more information."], "extent": [717, 934]}, {"level": 1, "id": "parameters", "container": true, "type": "parameters_section", "indent": 0, "role": "section", "extent": [934, 946], "body": [{"type": "parameters_item_group", "body": [{"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Pattern"], "extent": [946, 956], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["A pattern that filters for a subset of skeleton joints on MixerAnim.skel. Only the specified joints are affected by the smoothing effect. This field accepts ", {"scheme": null, "value": "/character/kinefx/apexpathpattern", "type": "link", "text": ["APEX path patterns"], "fullpath": "/character/kinefx/apexpathpattern.html"}, ", for example, ", {"type": "q", "text": ["#L_*"]}, "."], "extent": [973, 1212]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "pattern"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Type"], "extent": [1212, 1218], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The type of filter to use."], "extent": [1238, 1270]}, {"type": "dt_group", "body": [{"type": "dt", "indent": 4, "text": ["Butterworth"], "extent": [1270, 1287], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 8, "text": ["This filter has a maximally flat magnitude in the passband, and is only available for low-pass and high-pass filters."], "extent": [1287, 1414]}], "container": true}], "container": true}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "filtertype"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Order"], "extent": [1414, 1421], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The order of the filter. Determines how steeply the filter curve rolls off after the cutoff frequency. Higher orders correspond to a steeper roll off. This is only used by Butterworth filters."], "extent": [1436, 1634]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "order"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Cutoff Frequency"], "extent": [1634, 1652], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The cutoff frequency for the filter, in hertz. Frequencies over this value are filtered out."], "extent": [1668, 1766]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "cutoff"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Components"], "extent": [1766, 1778], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["Applies the filter to the translation, rotation, and/or scale components."], "extent": [1798, 1877]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "components"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Transform Order"], "extent": [1877, 1894], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The transformation order to use when cracking and rebuilding the transformation matrices:"], "extent": [1908, 2011]}, {"type": "bullet_group", "body": [{"blevel": 6, "type": "bullet", "indent": 4, "text": ["Scale Rot Trans"], "extent": [2011, 2038]}, {"blevel": 6, "type": "bullet", "indent": 4, "text": ["Scale Trans Rot"], "extent": [2038, 2065]}, {"blevel": 6, "type": "bullet", "indent": 4, "text": ["Rot Scale Trans"], "extent": [2065, 2096]}, {"blevel": 6, "type": "bullet", "indent": 4, "text": ["Rot Trans Scale"], "extent": [2096, 2127]}, {"blevel": 6, "type": "bullet", "indent": 4, "text": ["Trans Scale Rot"], "extent": [2127, 2158]}, {"blevel": 6, "type": "bullet", "indent": 4, "text": ["Trans Rot Scale"], "extent": [2158, 2181]}], "container": true}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "xord"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Rotate Order"], "extent": [2181, 2195], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The rotation order to use when cracking and rebuilding the transformation matrices:"], "extent": [2209, 2302]}, {"type": "bullet_group", "body": [{"blevel": 6, "type": "bullet", "indent": 4, "text": ["Rx Ry Rz"], "extent": [2302, 2326]}, {"blevel": 6, "type": "bullet", "indent": 4, "text": ["Rx Rz Ry"], "extent": [2326, 2350]}, {"blevel": 6, "type": "bullet", "indent": 4, "text": ["Ry Rx Rz"], "extent": [2350, 2374]}, {"blevel": 6, "type": "bullet", "indent": 4, "text": ["Ry Rz Rx"], "extent": [2374, 2398]}, {"blevel": 6, "type": "bullet", "indent": 4, "text": ["Rz Rx Ry"], "extent": [2398, 2422]}, {"blevel": 6, "type": "bullet", "indent": 4, "text": ["Rz Ry Rx"], "extent": [2422, 2442]}], "container": true}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "rord"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Window"], "extent": [2442, 2450], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The number of frames to evaluate around the current frame. A window of 0 evaluates only the current frame. A value of 1 evaluates 1 frame before the current frame, the current frame, and 1 frame after the current frame."], "extent": [2466, 2695]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "window"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Rate"], "extent": [2695, 2701], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["The sampling rate, in frames per second, when computing the frames for the window."], "extent": [2715, 2807]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "rate"}, "role": "item"}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}], "text": "Parameters"}, {"level": 1, "id": "related", "container": true, "type": "related_section", "indent": 0, "role": "section", "extent": [2807, 2816], "body": [{"type": "bullet_group", "body": [{"blevel": 2, "type": "bullet", "indent": 0, "text": [{"scheme": null, "value": "/character/kinefx/motionmixer", "type": "link", "text": ["Motion mixer"], "fullpath": "/character/kinefx/motionmixer.html"}], "extent": [2816, 2863]}, {"blevel": 2, "type": "bullet", "indent": 0, "text": [{"scheme": null, "value": "/ref/panes/motionmixer", "type": "link", "text": ["Motion mixer pane"], "fullpath": "/ref/panes/motionmixer.html"}], "extent": [2863, 2908]}, {"blevel": 2, "type": "bullet", "indent": 0, "text": [{"scheme": "Node", "value": "/nodes/sop/kinefx--motionmixer", "type": "link", "text": "", "fullpath": "/nodes/sop/kinefx--motionmixer.html"}], "extent": [2908, 2941]}, {"blevel": 2, "type": "bullet", "indent": 0, "text": [{"scheme": "Node", "value": "/nodes/sop/kinefx--motionmixerfetch", "type": "link", "text": "", "fullpath": "/nodes/sop/kinefx--motionmixerfetch.html"}], "extent": [2941, 2979]}, {"blevel": 2, "type": "bullet", "indent": 0, "text": [{"scheme": "Node", "value": "/nodes/sop/kinefx--motionmixerretime", "type": "link", "text": "", "fullpath": "/nodes/sop/kinefx--motionmixerretime.html"}], "extent": [2979, 3018]}, {"blevel": 2, "type": "bullet", "indent": 0, "text": [{"scheme": "Node", "value": "/nodes/sop/kinefx--motionmixertransform", "type": "link", "text": "", "fullpath": "/nodes/sop/kinefx--motionmixertransform.html"}], "extent": [3018, 3060]}], "container": true}], "text": "Related"}], "title": ["Motion Mixer Smooth"], "summary": ["Defines a smooth effect for the motion mixer."], "included": ["/news/beta"]}